<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM KAPALUA INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM KAPALUA INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>KAPALUA, Hawaii 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>the final round of the $1.2 million Kapalua International</p>
<p>tournament on Sunday (two courses used in the tournament,</p>
<p>leaders listed in relation to par, U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>  1. Paul Stankowski	  21 under par</p>
<p>  2. Fred Couples	    -20</p>
<p>  3. Davis Love III	  -19</p>
<p>  3. Steve Jones	     -19</p>
<p>  5. Sandy Lyle (Britain)  -17</p>
<p>  5. Bob Gilder		-17</p>
<p>  7. Peter Jacobsen	  -16</p>
<p>  8. Stewart Cink	    -14</p>
<p>  8. Scott McCarron	  -14</p>
<p> 10. Duffy Waldorf	   -13</p>
<p> 10. Billy Mayfair	   -13</p>
